WEBVTT

00:08:29.198 --> 00:08:32.136
a chance to go through role playing,

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:34.956
social drama,

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:38.501
pretending that you were beating someone

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:41.843
or knocking someone down,

00:08:41.867 --> 00:08:44.085
someone's blowing smoke in your face

00:08:44.109 --> 00:08:47.016
and calling you all types of names,

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:51.335
training people how to be disciplined

00:08:51.359 --> 00:08:52.622
and not giving up.

00:08:52.646 --> 00:08:56.474
On the Freedom Rides in May of 1961,

00:08:56.498 --> 00:08:58.964
when I was 21 years old,

00:08:58.988 --> 00:09:02.005
leaving Washington, DC, for the first time